{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52060","headline":"九月九日 · 王绩","name":"九月九日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九日重阳节，三秋季月残。\n菊花催晚［气］（据《古今岁时杂咏》补），萸房避早寒。\n霜浓鹰击远，雾重雁飞难。\n谁忆龙山外，萧条边兴阑？\n（按：《古今岁时杂咏》卷三十三以此诗爲崔善爲作，《全唐诗》卷八八二据以收入。\n今移正重收。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}